WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.009
People will come up
to me and say, "Ugh!",

00:00:02.009 --> 00:00:04.750
"If only I had heard
about this five years ago,

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:06.615
I wouldn't be
divorced right now."

00:00:09.390 --> 00:00:12.780
Radical Candor is caring
personally and challenging

00:00:12.780 --> 00:00:14.295
directly at the same time.

00:00:17.290 --> 00:00:19.575
It all starts with
soliciting feedback.

00:00:19.575 --> 00:00:21.700
Don't dish it out before
you prove you can take it.

00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:25.720
I like to ask, "What could I do
or stop doing that would make

00:00:25.720 --> 00:00:27.250
it easier to work with me?"

00:00:27.250 --> 00:00:29.440
You will give
criticism and you'll

00:00:29.440 --> 00:00:32.950
learn how to gauge how what
you're saying is landing.

00:00:32.950 --> 00:00:37.360
Am I hearing you say that I
can be very "micromanage-y"?

00:00:37.360 --> 00:00:37.910
Yeah.

00:00:37.910 --> 00:00:38.410
OK.

00:00:41.940 --> 00:00:43.860
You'll walk away
with a tool kit that

00:00:43.860 --> 00:00:46.230
will help you navigate
even the toughest

00:00:46.230 --> 00:00:49.490
conversations with confidence.

